eng:phase6-line014:m0144"}],"rationale":"宣帝字仲達及朗字伯達、安平獻王孚、宣帝弟馗與既有完整原段接合；雋/儁依元異及防父子鏈，保存異字。單字通不是蒯通等其他同名人物。","references":[],"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:phase6-line014","unit_id":"anpingfu-intro","text":"安平獻王孚，字叔達，宣帝次弟也。初，孚長兄朗字伯達，宣帝字仲達，孚弟馗字季達，恂字顯達，進字惠達，通字雅達，敏字幼達，俱知名，故時號為「八達」焉。孚溫厚廉讓，博涉經史。漢末喪亂，與兄弟處危亡之中，簞食瓢飲，而披閱不倦。性通恕，以貞白自立，未嘗有怨於人。陳留殷武有名於海內，嘗罹罪譴，孚往省之，遂與同處分食，談者稱焉。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:phase6-line014:m0000","start":0,"end":5,"surface":"安平獻王孚","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本段上下文辨識；不據同名強併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:phase6-line014:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"叔達","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本段上下文辨識；不據同名強併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:phase6-line014:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"宣帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本段上下文辨識；不據同名強併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:phase6-line014:m0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"孚","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本段上下文辨識；不據同名強併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:phase6-line014:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"朗","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本段上下文辨識；不據同名強併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:phase6-line014:m0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"伯達","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本段上下文辨識；不據同名強併。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:phase6-line014:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"宣帝","kind":"person","person_id":"d